	'messages:apihelp-query+filerepoinfo-paramvalue-prop-name' => 'lij:A ciâve do depòxito, dêuviâ prezénpio inte <var>[[mw:Special:MyLanguage/Manual:$wgForeignFileRepos|$wgForeignFileRepos]]</var> e [[Special:ApiHelp/query+imageinfo|imageinfo]] - a restitoìsce di valoî.',
